# Project Code Review

Establish the exact diff and repository boundary. Read applicable instructions and owners. Prioritize defects, regressions, unsafe behavior, broken contracts, missing validation, and stale current-state documentation. Verify claims against source and configuration. Report findings by severity with precise locations and evidence; state when no actionable finding remains and list validation gaps separately.
